  "body": "## Why\n\nPlan discovery slice: `bf agents` must list every live coding session on this host without talking to a model.\n\n## What\n\n- `/proc` scan classified as claude/codex/cursor/grok\n- Overlay `~/.claude/sessions/*.json`, `~/.codex/session_index.jsonl`, `~/.grok/active_sessions.json`, Cursor `--resume=`\n- Dead registry rows dropped; a bash argv that only *mentions* `cursor-agent/versions` is not Cursor\n- `tests/cli_agents.rs`: four-provider fixture + 200-pid < 500ms\n- `bf agents` is no longer a stub (cli_skeleton unimplemented list updated)\n\n## Verification\n\n- `bash scripts/check` EXIT 0\n- This host: 30+ live rows across all four providers in 0.34s (`/usr/bin/time`)\n\n## Review\n\nAuthor vendor: **grok**. Needs a non-grok `REVIEW: approve <head-sha>` then `gh pr merge --rebase --delete-branch`.\n\nbf-author: grok/grok-4.6\nbf-claim: grok/pr4-agents",
